		{
			"id": "eYaOxgm_5rnh362l-",
			"description": "Twin Adrathic Destructor",
			"local_notes": "Twin-mounted heavy energy weapon carried by Custodes Contemptor- and Telemon-pattern dreadnoughts (Allarus/Aquilon-adjacent heavy armour) rather than by an infantry Custodian; both barrels fire together per the twin-linked convention.\n\nLore: The adrathic destructor is Codex-listed heavy dreadnought armament for Custodes armoured assets; background describes it in the same breath as a lascannon for lethality against vehicles and monstrous targets, without giving a precise technical breakdown of the beam itself.\n\nDesign: A deliberate direct use of the framework's Lascannon anchor (8dx8(5) burn) per barrel, not an independent derivation, on the reasoning that \"same order of lethality as a lascannon\" is the most concrete claim the lore supports, twin- linked (\"rof: 1x2\") for two simultaneous shots as the Storm Bolter entry models twin boltguns. By exact dice distribution (avg 224 per barrel, min possible roll 64) it penetrates every AV row, from AV10 (DR 125, eff. 25) up through AV14 (DR 440, eff. 88), and Allarus plate (DR 250, eff. 50), at 99.99% per barrel - the framework's own Lascannon anchor is stated to \"kill AV14 (eff. DR 88) and Terminators\", and the exact dice distribution bears that out: only rolls of 11 or less on 8d (about 1 in 10,000) fall short of AV14's threshold. The exception is the DR 1350 glacis of a Leman Russ front or Land Raider (eff. 270), which each barrel penetrates only 13% of the time. Twin-linking two such barrels together is therefore redundant against most single targets and is better read as either engaging two targets at once or as the kind of margin a dreadnought-grade weapon is built with against the toughest xenos war-engines this project doesn't model numerically. Weight (380 lb) and ST (28M, mount-only) reflect genuine vehicle/dreadnought armament rather than anything a Custodian carries by hand; Bulk -8 and Rcl 2 follow the same convention as other braced/mounted heavy weapons in this project.",
			"tags": [
				"Missile Weapon",
				"Imperium",
				"Adeptus Custodes"
			],
			"tech_level": "12",
			"legality_class": "0",
			"base_value": "220000",
			"base_weight": "380 lb",
